          </a>
          <a href="https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=100050506784663" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Facebook" class="btn btn-outline-body btn-square me-1">
            <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M24 12.073c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12s-12 5.373-12 12c0 5.99 4.388 10.954 10.125 11.854v-8.385H7.078v-3.47h3.047V9.43c0-3.007 1.792-4.669 4.533-4.669 1.312 0 2.686.235 2.686.235v2.953H15.83c-1.491 0-1.956.925-1.956 1.874v2.25h3.328l-.532 3.47h-2.796v8.385C19.612 23.027 24 18.062 24 12.073z"/></svg>
          </a>
          <a href="https://www.google.com/search?q=opportunity+painting+reviews&rlz=1CDGOYI_enUS777US777&oq=opportunity+painting+reviews&aqs=chrome..69i57j0i546l5.954j0j4&hl=en-US&sourceid=chrome-mobile&ie=UTF-8#lkt=LocalPoiReviews&lpg=cid:CgIgAQ%3D%3D&trex=m_t:lcl_akp,rc_f" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Google Reviews" class="btn btn-outline-body btn-square me-1">
